n, faun.  Always male, higher-level and harder to kill
than nymphs, especially in the middle game, the faun
has a similar charming attack but unlike nymphs he
can reach into containers and pluck an item out.  The
faun has a taste for music:  he will always steal a
musical instrument if you have one, preferring artifact
instruments first, followed by tonal ones, with plain
bells and whatnot being a last resort.  Only if you
have no instruments at all will he steal anything else.
Fauns are generated with the same inventory options
as nymphs.

n, satyr.  Similar to a faun, but higher-level, when a
satyr steals from you he doesn't just warp to the
other side of the level: he levelports to who only
knows where (but only to levels that have already
been visited by you at least once).  Satyrs have a
1-in-3 chance to be generated with a wand of create
monster, in addition to what nymphs and fauns get.


